#
# Ubuntu 26.04 LTS base rows for the desktop image dry run.
# Format: status<TAB>name<TAB>note
# status is included, excluded, or unnamed.
# The dry run does not install any row.

included	nodejs	Ubuntu 26.04 nodejs package, path /usr/bin/node. Version 22.22.1 is the figure recorded in docs/PACKAGING.md D1. This dry run does not install it and does not re-query the archive.
excluded	unattended-upgrades	Stays off the image. Updates stay on the image channel in docs/PACKAGING.md section 9.
unnamed	kernel	Ubuntu 26.04 kernel. docs/PACKAGING.md D1 does not name an apt package.
unnamed	firmware	Ubuntu 26.04 firmware. docs/PACKAGING.md D1 does not name an apt package.
